# tally 2.1.8 item 77 (item 14 of the third turn; the review's G1, g1_pending): ob, 200.00 PLN out of pot on
# 04-07, is refused on every day of oa's window and its words differ by the day, so pot is the hole; oa, never
# refused, keeps its 10.00 PLN at jar and in its flows (j1, j3), as every pin and windows each print.
# 435db654 printed the hole for j1 and j3.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind savings: place PLN min 0
place pot: savings lives 2025-01-01..
place jar: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input wa: date
input db: date
input small: money PLN
input amt2: money PLN

move oa: transfers
  on wa
  leg cash from pot to jar amount small

move ob: transfers
  on db
  leg cash from pot to world amount amt2

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  small = 10.00 PLN "s"
  amt2 = 200.00 PLN "s"
  wa = one_of([2026-04-05, 2026-04-09]) "s"
  db = 2026-04-07 "s"
  opening[pot] = 50.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[jar] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask j1: bal(jar, 2026-04-30)
ask j2: bal(jar, 2026-04-30) windows each
ask j3: flows(oa, 2026-04)
ask j4: bal(jar, 2026-04-30) with wa = 2026-04-05
ask j5: bal(jar, 2026-04-30) with wa = 2026-04-09
ask j6: flows(oa, 2026-04) with wa = 2026-04-09
=== expect
j1: 10.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
j2: 10.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
j3: 10.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
j4: 10.00 PLN
  pinned: wa = 2026-04-05
  cut 2026-01-01
j5: 10.00 PLN
  pinned: wa = 2026-04-09
  cut 2026-01-01
j6: 10.00 PLN
  pinned: wa = 2026-04-09
  cut 2026-01-01
